'''Staraptor''' (Japanese: '''ムクホーク''' ''Mukuhawk'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

