==Trivia==
*This card's illustration rare print features {{p|Staraptor}} and a flock of {{p|Starly}} and {{p|Staravia}}.
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Staraptor|83}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion; both cards have the Clutch attack.
*'''Clutch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Lt. Surge's Fearow|7}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

